{"version":1,"content":"<p>聯合國最高司法機構國際法院近日裁定，緬甸政府在2016年至2017年期間針對羅興亞穆斯林少數族羣實施了國家支持的種族滅絕行為。法院在判決中指出，Facebook在緬甸軍方傳播針對羅興亞人的仇恨言論過程中發揮了重要作用。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587314.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:24:32.597000+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:57:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T17:17:39.549462+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T17:17:39.549462+00:00","content_hash":"2028cc6fa2f442b48be3f113373a0b9c1ab4fba7be07c5321726efa5d7a3eca8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}